cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Plotlas in your research, please cite it as below."
title: Plotlas
abstract: >-
  Plotlas is a self-hosted platform for exploring very large image datasets
  (100k–1M+ images) as a pannable, zoomable atlas in the browser. A pipeline turns
  a folder of images, plus optional metadata, into pre-baked per-layout spatial
  tile pyramids; a service serves them; a web frontend renders them.
type: software
authors:
